{"id":"bullock","name":"Bullock","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:bullock"],"groups":["Uses of","Laws concerning"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Bullock","text":"(1.) The translation of a word which is a generic name for horned cattle (Isa. 65:25). It is also rendered “cow” (Ezek. 4:15), “ox” (Gen. 12:16). (2.) The translation of a word always meaning an animal of the ox kind, without distinction of age or sex (Hos. 12:11). It is rendered “cow” (Num. 18:17) and “ox” (Lev. 17:3). (3.) Another word is rendered in the same way (Jer. 31:18). It is also translated “calf” (Lev. 9:3; Micah 6:6). It is the same word used of the “molten calf” (Ex. 32:4, 8) and “the golden calf” (1 Kings 12:28). (4.) In Judg. 6:25; Isa. 34:7, the Hebrew word is different. It is the customary word for bulls offered in sacrifice. In Hos. 14:2, the Authorized Version has “calves,” the Revised Version “bullocks.”"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H7794","lemma":"שׁוֹר","xlit":"shôwr","gloss":"a bullock","kjv":"bull, cow, ox, wall )","count":17,"share":0.22},{"strong":"H6499","lemma":"פַּר","xlit":"par","gloss":"a bullock","kjv":"bull, calf, ox","count":17,"share":0.22},{"strong":"H1241","lemma":"בָּקָר","xlit":"bâqâr","gloss":"beef cattle or an animal of the ox family of either gend","kjv":"beeve, bull, calf, cow","count":14,"share":0.18},{"strong":"H352","lemma":"אַיִל","xlit":"ʼayil","gloss":"strength","kjv":"mighty, lintel, oak, post","count":10,"share":0.13},{"strong":"H3532","lemma":"כֶּבֶשׂ","xlit":"kebes","gloss":"a ram","kjv":"lamb, sheep","count":9,"share":0.12},{"strong":"H7999","lemma":"שָׁלַם","xlit":"shâlam","gloss":"to be safe","kjv":"make amends, end, finish, full","count":9,"share":0.12}],"verses":["Exod.21.28","Exod.21.29","Exod.21.32","Exod.21.33","Exod.21.35","Exod.21.36","Exod.22.1","Exod.22.4","Exod.22.9","Exod.22.10","Exod.23.12","Num.7.3","Deut.22.10","Deut.25.4","Prov.14.4","Isa.32.20","Ezek.1.10","Exod.21.30","Exod.21.31","Exod.21.34","Exod.22.2","E